00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:00.680
You saved us, Miss Serara.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:05.010
Crescent Moon 
Alliance Guild Hall

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:05.010
Japan Server

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:05.010
Akiba

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:03.430
Thank you for coming outside to get us!

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:05.550
Thank you very much.

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:07.590
So this door is okay?

00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:10.640
But the zone settings seem unstable.

00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:14.390
Minori?

00:02:14.390 --> 00:02:15.680
There are 17 of them.

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:19.800
With us, there are exactly 24 in total.

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:24.470
We're inside of a dungeon created
using Akiba's map data right now.

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:30.260
Monsters are on the street and inside
big buildings like this Guild Building.

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:35.050
And Shiroe speculates the raid boss,
the ringleader of this strange event,

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:38.970
is on the top floor
of this Guild Building.

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:40.800
It's the Despair Genius, Ereinus.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.760
It's dark and huge!

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:46.760
High-level Adventurers
are probably no longer in Akiba.

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:48.760
It seems those at level 70 or above

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:52.640
had their levels forcibly reduced
and ended up being defeated.

00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:57.260
So that's why we didn't see Marielle
and the others in the morning, huh?

00:02:57.260 --> 00:02:59.970
But you were okay, Akatsuki?

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:05.140
Yeah, since I happened to match
Minori's level using the Teacher System.

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:07.550
What? Hold on a sec.

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:09.720
Then does it possibly mean...

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:13.680
Right. To resolve this situation,

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:16.890
we have no choice but to challenge
the raid with the members here...

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:19.550
...all 24 of us.

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:26.680
Despair Genius

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:25.260
"Despair Genius."

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:29.340
What? Are we gonna be okay?

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:30.590
That's reckless.

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:33.390
I don't have much raid experience.

00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:38.260
We can't do something
incredible like that.

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:41.800
Yeah. It's natural to be worried.

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:46.840
The note from Shiroe said to find
raid members at the Guild Building.

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:51.640
I bet he was thinking about everyone
from the Crescent Moon Alliance

