00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:57.260
But...

00:03:57.260 --> 00:04:00.840
Does it mean the situation
won't change if we don't do it?

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:03.180
If we wait, someone might come rescue us.

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:07.180
I suspect that once the level
is reduced, it won't go back up

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:12.090
unless we defeat the raid boss
in this dungeon... the Genius.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:15.470
Then no help is coming?

00:04:15.470 --> 00:04:19.470
I can't say irresponsible things
like "We can definitely win."

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:22.510
I can't force them to fight, either.

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:23.930
What do I do?

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:25.930
What on earth can I do?

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:28.970
Let's do it!

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:30.890
Let's do the raid!

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:34.550
Because if we do it, we can win, right?!

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:36.720
We could lose, you know.

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:40.510
Sure, we might lose in this raid...

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:45.430
...but we can overcome the feeling
that things will work out if we wait!

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:56.430
What does he mean?

00:04:56.430 --> 00:05:00.180
We were like that, so...

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:06.680
Minori, Toya, me, and everyone
else here was seized in Hamelin.

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:10.090
We thought someone might come
and rescue us if we waited.

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:11.970
We held onto a slight
hope like that at times,

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:15.340
and at other times, we gave up,
thinking there was no way it'd happen.

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:19.260
That's how we lived those days.

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:24.260
All we did that time was act
exactly as we were told by Shiroe.

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:26.640
Other people helped us, too.

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:32.550
We just ran.

00:05:32.550 --> 00:05:35.470
Yeah, without knowing anything.

00:05:35.470 --> 00:05:38.260
We were told to open
the door and get outside.

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:40.930
We just did what we were told.

00:05:40.930 --> 00:05:44.300
But this time, we're gonna
open it with our own will!

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:48.970
Not to run, but to move forward!

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:50.800
Let's do it!

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.300
Yeah, why not?

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:56.890
Yeah. We can do it, right?
We can do it this time!

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:59.800
All we have to do is fight.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:01.140
That's simple.

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:02.890
Let's do a raid!

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:05.760
So it's like a do-over of that time, huh?

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:11.640
What's the matter?

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:13.800
It's always like this.

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:18.930
Toya easily succeeds
in doing things I can't do.

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:21.470
It's really frustrating.

00:06:22.390 --> 00:06:24.890
Minori! Explain the details!

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:26.610
Genius

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:32.510
I think this is the first raid for a lot
of us, but there's no time for training.

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:37.760
By using the formation I explained
earlier as a base, we'll improvise.

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:40.760
Akatsuki. Could you take care of scouting?

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:42.140
Of course.

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:43.260
Do we have potions?

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:46.590
Doesn't a raid require all sorts of items?

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:48.260
I've prepared them.

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:49.390
Yep.

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:50.970
So what about the commander?

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.510
Who'll be the raid leader?

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:53.720
Ah...

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:02.430
You take command, Minori.

00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:03.590
What?

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:06.390
It'll be fine. You can do it.

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:08.390
Trust your tenacity.

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:10.050
Akatsuki...

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:13.260
Okay.

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:18.550
I'll take command of this raid!
I'm the raid leader!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:23.330
Guild Building

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:23.330
Japan Server

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:23.330
Akiba

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:29.340
How was it?

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:33.140
The further you go up,
the heavier their defense is.

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:36.390
The Genius is probably
at the very top floor...

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:40.470
...in the Luquenje Hall.

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:42.890
Okay! Let's begin!

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:47.640
We're starting the raid, Shiroe.

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:51.930
The basic large-scale battle is

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:55.970
a full raid in which
24 people participate.

00:07:55.970 --> 00:07:58.220
Create four parties with six members each

00:07:58.220 --> 00:08:03.470
and have each party associate with
a tactic. This is called party formation.

00:08:03.470 --> 00:08:07.010
Deciding the parties is
the first thing you do in a raid.

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:09.760
The first party is especially important.

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:08.680
Samurai's Challenge!

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:09.760
Reactive Heal!

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:12.010
Pick a Warrior you can trust the most

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:11.130
Keen Edge!

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:14.140
and three healers in
different classes, if possible.

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:14.050
Echo Rebound!

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:15.090
Pulse Bullet!

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:18.760
In preparation for a long-drawn-out
battle, post an Enchanter or a Bard.

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:18.300
Accelerator Fang!

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:23.050
Two boars and three bats ahead!

00:08:23.050 --> 00:08:24.090
Crap!

00:08:24.090 --> 00:08:27.640
The second party acts as a reserve
for the first party or a mobile unit.

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:26.480
Anchor Howl!

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:28.220
Purification Barrier!

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:29.560
You want at least two healers.

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:29.090
Reactive Heal!

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:30.140
Heartbeat Healing!

00:08:30.140 --> 00:08:32.760
For the third and fourth parties,
have less healing

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:32.650
Divine Might!

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:35.180
and focus on attacking power.

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:34.650
Rapid Shot!

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:37.510
Repeat Notes!

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:40.010
Orb of Lava!

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:42.840
With the people we have here,

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:47.260
I couldn't form parties in a
well-balanced manner like Shiroe said.

00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:51.340
We're a clumsy team with few raid
experiences created on the spot, but...

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:55.010
Whoa! It'll be a problem if
we don't crush the enemy's rear!

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:58.220
If we could break their
formation and move ahead...

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:02.720
Hey, Nagi. Use that thing.
The one with toilet water gushing out.

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:05.760
"Gushing"... Oh, I got it!

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:08.340
Freezing Liner!

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:10.390
We know each other very well.

00:09:10.390 --> 00:09:14.680
We have strong camaraderie!

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:18.720
Change the front! Team C,
charge and stay there as tanks!

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:20.050
Copy that!

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:21.680
Leave it to us!

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:26.590
Serara! Litka! Yuzu!
Focus on assisting the offense!

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:26.590
When giving separate instructions,
ask by calling their individual names.

00:09:26.590 --> 00:09:30.260
Think about what they want to do.

00:09:26.590 --> 00:09:30.260
Let the others do the healing!

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:34.640
Don't give instructions to the
entire group, like "Healers! Do this!"

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:38.010
Give instructions differently depending
on if it's an individual or a group.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:40.800
tateWaki! Go ahead and move to the front!

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:44.050
Is that okay? I can speed things up!

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:48.340
All right! Mush-Mush Ka-pow!

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:50.340
I don't know the reason for it,

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:54.300
but I believe there is one
and will continue doing this!

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:58.430
The job of the raid leader is to create
teams that can lead you to victory.

00:09:58.430 --> 00:10:01.720
The battle is decided
by how you create your teams.

00:10:07.930 --> 00:10:09.340
They are...

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:15.220
Samurai's Challenge!

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:17.800
What's the matter?

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:20.340
Well... It was probably my imagination.

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:27.590
We made it!

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:32.470
A break would be nice, but if we
take time, small fries will likely gather.

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:34.720
Guys! It'll be hard to use

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:37.970
recovery potions during
the battle, so drink it now!

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:41.930
Also, drink enhancement potions and
while you're at it, eat sandwiches, too!

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:42.970
That's a lot of potions!

00:10:42.970 --> 00:10:45.300
They must've cost a lot!

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:49.800
Don't lose your head over preparation.
Don't be afraid of not having enough.

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:53.510
Are you guys ready?!

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:56.800
We'll fight the decisive
battle in there! Let's go!

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:58.550
Yeah!

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:03.050
"The full raid's final showdown"
"Child's Replay"

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:07.510
So those kids are fighting
a raid in there, huh?

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:10.140
That's only if things are going smoothly.

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:14.590
We don't even know if the useless sisters
were able to join them, so...

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:18.220
There isn't even a
way to check it, either.

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:20.970
They were fighting splendidly.

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:22.550
Sojiro!

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:26.180
Though I didn't see the results
since I was also taken down.

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:30.760
You were fighting in the
other side's Guild Building?

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:35.180
It's amazing how you could see
that far when you were only level 35.

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:38.970
My Oral Arts specialize
in defense and evasion, so...

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:42.800
Most of them have no
raid experience, and yet...

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:45.590
All we can do is wait.

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:48.640
Waiting is also a raid.

00:11:51.050 --> 00:11:52.220
Huh?!

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:54.090
There's no one in here.

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:03.390
There he is! There he is!

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:05.680
That's Ereinus, a Genius!

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.950
Despair Genius

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.950
Ereinus: Genius

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.950
Rank: Raid

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:12.340
Target confirmed! Let's first fight
in the formation we planned!

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:15.930
Okay! Head Splitter!

00:12:15.930 --> 00:12:19.220
I'm gonna earn hostility and get him
to concentrate his attacks on me!

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:20.840
Dim Crossing!

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:24.010
Purification Barrier!

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:24.670
Reactive Heal!

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:28.800
Heartbeat Healing!

00:12:29.090 --> 00:12:32.060
Toya

00:12:29.090 --> 00:12:32.060
Human

00:12:29.090 --> 00:12:32.060
Samurai

00:12:29.090 --> 00:12:32.060
Log Horizon

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:32.930
My HP is already down by ten percent

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:36.220
even though I'm receiving
more support spells than usual!

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:39.260
This is a raid!

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:40.840
He started moving!

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:42.300
Adjust your position!

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:45.800
Team C and D! Concentrate
your attacks on his sides!

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:47.180
Now!

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:49.680
Round Carol!

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:51.510
Serpent Bolt!

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:53.050
Rapid Shot!

00:12:56.470 --> 00:12:58.640
Close range attack, please!

00:12:58.640 --> 00:12:59.830
Head Splitter!

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:00.750
Crescent Raker!

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:02.090
Venom Strike!

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:03.720
Viper's Trash!

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:05.380
Judgment Hell!

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:05.760
Extermination!

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:08.430
Hey, this way!

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:09.970
Samurai's Challenge!

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:12.140
Turning Swallow!

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:14.760
Let's keep this rotation
for a while to reduce his HP!

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:16.180
Yeah!

00:13:16.180 --> 00:13:20.590
After the battle started,
Toya slid into the enemy's left side.

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:23.430
He did it to get the enemy's attention.

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:27.930
My Master was doing that when
we went hunting and training, so...!

00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:34.680
He's gonna do something!

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:37.550
Guys! Defend and evade!

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:44.920
Toya

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:44.920
Human

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:44.920
Samurai

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:44.920
Log Horizon

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:45.590
One shot did all this?!

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:48.050
Druids! Cast Gaia Beat!

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:51.550
To cancel the debuff, use your potion!

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:50.800
Gaia Beat Healing!

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:54.340
Minori! Four are down!

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:57.180
Kuu! Put a priority on
casting Resurrection on them!

00:13:57.180 --> 00:14:01.140
Team A! Concentrate your support on Toya!
The rear will cover you!

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:05.300
It was flame damage! Guys!
Drink the red label potion!

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:07.900
Don't be hasty and disturb the rhythm!

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:08.240
Resurrection!

00:14:08.720 --> 00:14:12.640
When unable to fight, we can
recover them with a resurrection spell,

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:16.090
but they only get back
about half of their MP.

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:19.140
tateWaki! Step back and redo the buff!

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:23.010
Nagi! Focus on single spells
with frost alignment!

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:26.640
If your Cherry Tree Twig Hitokata
effects wore off, use it again!

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:30.340
LaDieve! Yupia! Use Princess
Goldfish Hitokata as well!

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.390
We'll attract his attention!

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:38.050
Go ahead and recover now!

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:40.090
Thanks!

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:43.050
Oh crap! He's on all fours!

00:14:43.050 --> 00:14:44.800
He's gonna do that thing again!

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:46.590
What?! This is too soon!

00:14:46.590 --> 00:14:48.640
We haven't been able to reco--

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:50.510
Litka!

00:14:50.510 --> 00:14:54.510
For Shiro-Shiro and Teto-Teto,
Litka will do it!

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:58.140
Come out! Come out! Scale Snake!

00:14:58.140 --> 00:15:02.180
Now is the time to wriggle and gather!

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:05.340
It doesn't look like a snake.

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:08.760
Go! Lizard King!

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:10.090
Give him a good beating!

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:12.300
She called it a lizard herself!

00:15:15.840 --> 00:15:17.260
It let out a "Moo."

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:19.590
It's like a cow!

00:15:19.590 --> 00:15:20.680
Hm?

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:23.010
His wide-ranged attack isn't coming...?

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:26.890
That Genius can't generate fire
unless he is in a low position!

00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:30.010
This is our chance! Those with weapons,
assault him from behind!

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:33.970
Reduce his HP as much
as possible while you can!

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:36.050
Cast healing spells on Mr. Lizard!

00:15:36.050 --> 00:15:39.140
We're doing it, but it
seems less effective on him!

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:41.180
Don't worry! Don't worry!

00:15:41.180 --> 00:15:45.390
Lizard King is absolutely
invincible with scale power!

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:50.880
Lizard King

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:51.140
If your HP is low, step back and recover!

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:55.930
Magic Attack Class! Put a priority
on effectiveness while preserving MP!

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:58.890
It looks like it'll take time, but...!

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:00.840
We can do it! We can do it!

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:03.340
We can beat him!

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:07.650
Despair Genius

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:07.650
Ereinus: Genius

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:07.650
Rank: Raid

00:16:03.680 --> 00:16:07.810
Lizard King

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:09.140
Ereinus's HP hasn't been
reduced by even a third, but...

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:17.090
Raid bosses change their forms and
attack patterns when their HP gets low.

00:16:17.090 --> 00:16:21.640
The real battle begins now, right, Shiroe?

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:26.390
Are you a subject for veneration?

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:27.760
No!

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:30.010
Protective Barrier!

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:39.760
You are not a subject for veneration.

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:48.340
Do you all have a subject for veneration?

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:49.680
What?

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:53.050
Do you all have a subject for veneration?

00:16:59.430 --> 00:17:01.180
Calm down!

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:05.430
Do you all have a subject for veneration?!

00:17:05.430 --> 00:17:08.720
"Veneration"? Someone I respect?

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:12.840
What... was that?

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:17.140
What? Shiroe?

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:24.840
Shiro... e...!

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:27.760
Defense position! Watch your front!

00:17:31.090 --> 00:17:33.220
What was that?

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:36.680
Did the others receive the same attack?

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:39.720
Toya! The barriers are...!

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:43.010
Litka! Cast Heartbeat Healing again!

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:47.930
Komomo! Cast the responsive healing spell!

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:48.930
Komomo!

00:17:48.930 --> 00:17:51.840
Ah! Got it!

00:17:52.430 --> 00:17:55.840
If Toya is brought down,
this raid is gonna...

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:02.180
Toya

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:02.180
Human

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:02.180
Samurai

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:02.180
Log Horizon

00:18:02.550 --> 00:18:04.010
Toya!

00:18:04.010 --> 00:18:05.970
His movement is slow?

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:09.180
Something is wrong.
Normally, Toya wouldn't get hit

00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:11.680
by an attack with a big motion like that.

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:13.930
My Master...

00:18:13.930 --> 00:18:16.090
What's this...?

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:19.800
Do you all have a subject for veneration?

00:18:28.680 --> 00:18:31.590
I just saw someth--

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:35.590
Do you all have a subject for veneration?

00:18:50.180 --> 00:18:54.680
Ahh... These are... memories...

00:18:54.680 --> 00:18:56.050
Everyone's...

00:18:57.890 --> 00:18:59.550
My...!

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:18.140
Ahh... What shattered that time was...

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:23.430
Toya's memories with Naotsugu.

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:31.930
I understood and sensed
your subject for veneration.

00:19:32.840 --> 00:19:38.300
I understood and sensed
your subjects for veneration.

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:43.800
Lose hope. Your subjects for
veneration will not show up here.

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:46.930
You all are isolated in here.

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:48.890
That's not...!

00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:53.930
Lose hope. Your subjects
for veneration will not show up.

00:19:53.930 --> 00:19:57.300
You all are isolated in here.

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:59.090
So what?!

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:00.180
No!

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:04.090
Toya!

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:11.260
Secret Rite of a Thousand Means
to accelerate the cast time!

00:20:11.260 --> 00:20:15.050
Mirror of Ishikori to
enhance all damage reduction!

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:20.220
Magatama's Mystic Spell to attack Ereinus!

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:44.050
Minori!

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:49.930
Lose hope. Your subjects
for veneration have already fallen.

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:54.090
They lost their powers
and now rot on the ground.

00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:57.300
That's a lie!

00:20:57.300 --> 00:21:02.970
Lose hope. Your subjects
for veneration have already fallen.

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:08.180
You will receive no help and
morning will never come in this place.

00:21:08.180 --> 00:21:10.970
Shiroe is strong!

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:15.050
Lose hope. Your subjects for veneration

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:19.510
have lost their powers and
fallen to their knees before me.

00:21:19.510 --> 00:21:24.680
You all are far away from everything
and will be wrapped in nightfall.

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:28.050
Shiroe is... Shiroe!

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:41.010
Lose hope. Your subjects for veneration

00:21:41.010 --> 00:21:43.550
have lost their powers and
fallen to their knees before me.

00:21:43.550 --> 00:21:46.550
You all have been abandoned.

00:21:48.470 --> 00:21:50.340
Toya...

00:21:50.340 --> 00:21:56.050
Your subjects for veneration
have lost their ranks as heroes.

00:21:56.050 --> 00:21:57.800
No.

00:21:57.800 --> 00:22:03.640
My teacher is... Shiroe is never...!

00:22:03.640 --> 00:22:05.680
Rite of Divine--

00:22:21.680 --> 00:22:26.680
My lord was never a hero from the start.

00:22:26.680 --> 00:22:30.180
He's not a subject for veneration.

00:22:30.180 --> 00:22:33.260
My lord is... my lord!

00:24:06.220 --> 00:24:09.300
Akatsuki's shout and
the feelings of Lelia and Litka

00:24:09.300 --> 00:24:11.800
restores the young ones' morale.

00:24:11.800 --> 00:24:14.430
Trusting her comrades,
Minori takes command.

00:24:14.430 --> 00:24:18.840
She also has another battle awaiting
her that only she can face alone.

00:24:18.840 --> 00:24:22.890
In the end, the singing of little birds
reverberates across the ocean at dawn.

00:24:22.850 --> 00:24:29.980
Next Time

00:24:22.850 --> 00:24:29.980
Song of the Nightingales

00:24:22.890 --> 00:24:25.180
Next Time: "Song of the Nightingales."

00:24:25.180 --> 00:24:27.970
When you surpass yourself,
the world will change.
